{"id":182,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"広い視野と創造力を育む学習院中等科","feature_description":"学習院中等科は、ひろい視野・たくましい創造力・ゆたかな感受性を育てる教育方針が明快な学校です。公式サイトの部活動一覧には、運動部・文化部・同好会がそろい、学びと課外活動の両輪で中等教育を支えています。落ち着いた校風の中で、広い視野を養う構成が伝わります。 同好会まで含めた多彩な課外活動があり、学習面だけでなく興味関心を広げる環境が整っていることも確認できました。","clubs":[{"id":3367,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3368,"name":"硬式庭球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3369,"name":"古武道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3370,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3371,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3372,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3373,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3374,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3375,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3376,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3377,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3378,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},